      <ownedRepresentationDescriptors xmi:type="viewpoint:DRepresentationDescriptor" uid="_tCHPgB8eEfCxN8ZT_GmQhA" documentation="&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 29.03px 0px 19.35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 24.19px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); scroll-margin-top: 29.0304px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>Diagram: [OAB] 2.1.1.1 SE System Analysis Processes C1L5 - Transition&lt;/h2>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;>1. Name of the Diagram:&lt;/strong>&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>[OAB] 2.1.1.1 SE System Analysis Processes C1L5 - Transition&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;>2. Setting with respect to the ARCADIA method:&lt;/strong>&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>System Analysis&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 24.19px 0px 16.12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 20.16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); scroll-margin-top: 24.192px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>3. Operational Processes Noted on the Diagram&lt;/h3>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 24.19px 0px 16.12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 20.16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); scroll-margin-top: 24.192px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>SA- Transition Actors&lt;/h3>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;>Operational Process Description:&lt;/strong>&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>The process involves transitioning from OA Actors, refining actors and entities, and defining the operational capabilities and entities. The activities start with the initial activity &amp;quot;Define Operational Capabilties and Entities [OCB}&amp;quot; which does not have any explicit input flow, indicating it as an initial point.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p class=&quot;owner&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;>Owner:&lt;/strong>&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>System Engineer&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 24.19px 0px 16.12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 20.16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); scroll-margin-top: 24.192px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>SA - Transitional Activities&lt;/h3>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;>Operational Process Description:&lt;/strong>&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>This operational process involves transitioning activities and allocating operational activities to entities or roles involved in capabilities. &amp;quot;Transition Activites [OAB]&amp;quot; is the starting point, not defined with explicit inputs.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p class=&quot;owner&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;>Owner:&lt;/strong>&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>System Engineer&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 24.19px 0px 16.12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 20.16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); scroll-margin-top: 24.192px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>SA- Transition Capabilities&lt;/h3>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;>Operational Process Description:&lt;/strong>&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>This involves refining actors and entities, transitioning from OA actors, and focusing on capabilities and missions. Activities flow starting from &amp;quot;Transition from OA Actors, Entities and Capabilities [OCB]&amp;quot; with no specific inputs defined.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p class=&quot;owner&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;>Owner:&lt;/strong>&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>System Engineer&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 24.19px 0px 16.12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 20.16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); scroll-margin-top: 24.192px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3>&#xA;" name="[OAB] 2.1.1.1  SE System Analysis Processes C1L5 - Transition" repPath="#_tCGBYB8eEfCxN8ZT_GmQhA" changeId="1757006628304">
