      </ownedRepresentationDescriptors>
      <ownedRepresentationDescriptors xmi:type="viewpoint:DRepresentationDescriptor" uid="_sybzwCKzEfCxN8ZT_GmQhA" documentation="&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 29.03px 0px 19.35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 24.19px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); scroll-margin-top: 29.0304px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>Diagram: [OAB] 2.1.1.1 SE System Analysis Processes C1L5 (SYSML V1) - Transition&lt;/h2>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>This diagram is part of the System Analysis phase within the ARCADIA method.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 24.19px 0px 16.12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 20.16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); scroll-margin-top: 24.192px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>Operational Process Elements&lt;/h3>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; padding-left: 2em; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 0.5em; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li>&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;>Operational Process: SA - Transition (V1)&lt;/strong>&#xA;&#xA;&#x9;&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style: square; padding-left: 2em; margin-bottom: 0px;&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;li>Description: This operational process involves the transition phase of System Analysis. It is intended to ensure a smooth and methodical shift from initial operational capabilities, actors, and entities to a more defined system architecture.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;li>Involved Activities:&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style: circle; padding-left: 2em; margin-bottom: 0px;&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;li>Recursively Duplicate OA Model: An activity to replicate the operational analysis model iteratively for refinement.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;li>Define Actors and Entities [BDD]: Focuses on the specification and detailing of actors and entities using Block Definition Diagrams.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;li>Define Use Cases and Entities [UC]: Establishes and refines the relationship between use cases and entities.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;li>Functional Exchanges:&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style: circle; padding-left: 2em; margin-bottom: 0px;&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;li>Actors and Entities: A functional exchange linking defined actors and entities to their operational roles.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;li>UCs, Entities, Actors: This exchange ensures coherence between use cases and their respective actors and entities.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/ul>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/ul>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/ul>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&lt;/ul>&#xA;" name="[OAB] 2.1.1.1  SE System Analysis Processes C1L5 (SYSML V1) - Transition" repPath="#_sybMACKzEfCxN8ZT_GmQhA" changeId="1757007926838">
        <description xmi:type="description_1:DiagramDescription" href="platform:/plugin/org.polarsys.capella.core.sirius.analysis/description/oa.odesign#//@ownedViewpoints[name='Operational%20Analysis']/@ownedRepresentations[name='Operational%20Entity%20Blank']"/>
        <target xmi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.oa:EntityPkg" href="ARCADIA_Method.capella#b6c929f3-e9ce-47fe-9193-41a3b601dd36"/>
      </ownedRepresentationDescriptors>
      <ownedRepresentationDescriptors xmi:type="viewpoint:DRepresentationDescriptor" uid="_DT6coCK0EfCxN8ZT_GmQhA" documentation="&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 29.03px 0px 19.35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 24.19px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); scroll-margin-top: 29.0304px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>Diagram: [OAB] 2.1.1.3 SE System Analysis Processes C1L5 (SYSML V1) Refine Actors and Entities&lt;/h2>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>This diagram belongs to the System Analysis phase of the ARCADIA method. It focuses on refining the actors and entities in a system model context.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 24.19px 0px 16.12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 20.16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); scroll-margin-top: 24.192px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>Operational Process Elements&lt;/h3>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>The operational process involved in this diagram includes several activities and functional exchanges. Here is a structured description:&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; padding-left: 2em; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 1em; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li>&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;>Activity: Configure SA Model&lt;/strong>&lt;br />&#xA;&#x9;&lt;em style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;>Owner: System Engineer&lt;/em>&lt;br />&#xA;&#x9;- Inputs include Functional Chains, Scenarios, MCB Elements, Functions and Exchanges, SAB Elements, and more.&lt;br />&#xA;&#x9;- Outputs the System Analysis conclusion.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li>&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;>Activity: Refine Actors and Entities (BDD)&lt;/strong>&lt;br />&#xA;&#x9;&lt;em style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;>Owner: System Engineer&lt;/em>&lt;br />&#xA;&#x9;- Inputs involve Actors and Entities.&lt;br />&#xA;&#x9;- Outputs are Functional Exchanges such as Actors, Entities, and BDD.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li>&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;>Functional Exchange: BDD&lt;/strong>&lt;br />&#xA;&#x9;- Links the &amp;quot;Refine Actors and Entities (BDD)&amp;quot; activity with the &amp;quot;Configure SA Model&amp;quot; activity.&lt;/li>&#xA;&lt;/ul>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h4 style=&quot;margin: 20.16px 0px 13.44px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 16.8px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); scroll-margin-top: 20.16px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>Notes for Accessibility:&lt;/h4>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>Each operational process is outlined clearly, detailing the activities involved and the owner responsible for performing them.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 29.03px 0px 19.35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 24.19px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); scroll-margin-top: 29.0304px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>Diagram: SA - Refine Actors and Entities (V1)&lt;/h2>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>This diagram illustrates the SA (System Analysis) phase concerning refining actors and entities.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 24.19px 0px 16.12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 20.16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); scroll-margin-top: 24.192px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>Operational Process Elements&lt;/h3>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; padding-left: 2em; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 1em; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li>&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;>Involved Activity: Configure SA Model&lt;/strong>&lt;br />&#xA;&#x9;&lt;em style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;>Owner: System Engineer&lt;/em>&lt;br />&#xA;&#x9;- The activity encompasses setting up the system analysis model with various functional exchanges.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li>&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;>Involved Activity: Refine Actors and Entities (BDD)&lt;/strong>&lt;br />&#xA;&#x9;&lt;em style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;>Owner: System Engineer&lt;/em>&lt;br />&#xA;&#x9;- Focused on refining actors and entities within the system analysis context.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li>&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;>Functional Exchange: BDD&lt;/strong>&lt;br />&#xA;&#x9;- Involves refining processes connected through BDD (Block Definition Diagram) elements.&lt;/li>&#xA;&lt;/ul>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h4 style=&quot;margin: 20.16px 0px 13.44px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 16.8px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); scroll-margin-top: 20.16px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>Notes for Accessibility:&lt;/h4>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>The ownership and involvement of activities are highlighted to provide clarity about who performs each function.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 29.03px 0px 19.35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 24.19px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); scroll-margin-top: 29.0304px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>Diagram: SA - Refine Use Cases (V1)&lt;/h2>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 1em; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>This diagram ties into the SA phase, dedicated to refining use cases along with actors and entities.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 24.19px 0px 16.12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 20.16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); scroll-margin-top: 24.192px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>Operational Process Elements&lt;/h3>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; padding-left: 2em; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 1em; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li>&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;>Involved Activity: Configure SA Model&lt;/strong>&lt;br />&#xA;&#x9;&lt;em style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;>Owner: System Engineer&lt;/em>&lt;br />&#xA;&#x9;- A key activity for integrating use cases within the system analysis framework, connecting through relevant functional exchanges.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li>&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;>Involved Activity: Refine Actors, Entities, and Use Cases (UCD)&lt;/strong>&lt;br />&#xA;&#x9;&lt;em style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;>Owner: System Engineer&lt;/em>&lt;br />&#xA;&#x9;- Centers on refining the relationships and scenarios among actors, entities, and use cases.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li>&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;>Functional Exchange: UCs&lt;/strong>&lt;br />&#xA;&#x9;- Facilitates the interaction and transition of use case scenarios within the system.&lt;/li>&#xA;&lt;/ul>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h4 style=&quot;margin: 20.16px 0px 13.44px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 16.8px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); scroll-margin-top: 20.16px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>Notes for Accessibility:&lt;/h4>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;>The diagram highlights the collaboration between different activities and clarifies the flow of information. Text descriptions cater to individuals who may not have visual access to the diagrams but need to understand the processes involved.&lt;/p>&#xA;" name="[OAB] 2.1.1.3  SE System Analysis Processes C1L5 (SYSML V1) Refine Actors and Entities" repPath="#_DT504CK0EfCxN8ZT_GmQhA" changeId="1757008345158">
